            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey your way high and low, far and wide, just for the heck of it. Meet weirdos along the way. Explode things. Explode them good. It's a super quirky semi-retro platform-adventure. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pretty pixels for your eyeballs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whimsical music-sounds for your ear-holes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional one-button control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable input.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several hours of gameplay on first play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly writing. Cute n' quirky characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An instruction booklet, like the good ol' days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly: Adventure.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Default Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys to change direction. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z for jump/confirm and other actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X for &quot;back&quot; in menu.</p></li></ul>",
